<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vestige Archive | Moda Disiplini ve Kültürel Çalışmalar</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --burgundy: #800000;
            --cream: #F5F3EE;
            --black: #111111;
            --text-gray: #4A4A4A;
            --border-color: #E0DCD5;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--cream);
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: var(--black);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Üst Bilgi Barı */
       .top-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Ana Header */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0 20px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

       .header-utility {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 40px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

       .header-utility.left-side,.header-utility.right-side {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

       .header-utility span {
            margin: 0 10px;
        }

       .logo {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 82px;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

       .subtitle {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 400;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: inline-block;
            padding-top: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        /* Navigasyon */
        nav {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin: 20px 40px;
            padding: 15px 0;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin: 0 25px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--black);
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover, nav ul li a.active {
            color: var(--burgundy);
        }

        /* Hero Bölümü */
       .hero {
            display: flex;
            padding: 40px 80px;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

       .hero-text {
            flex: 1;
            padding-right: 60px;
        }

       .hero-label {
            color: var(--burgundy);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }

       .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 72px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

       .hero-description {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            max-width: 450px;
        }

       .btn-explore {
            background-color: var(--burgundy);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 15px 35px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

       .btn-explore:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

       .hero-visuals {
            flex: 2;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }

       .visual-img {
            max-height: 500px;
            filter: sepia(0.2) contrast(1.1);
        }

       .society-diagram {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10%;
            left: 45%;
            width: 250px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Featured Articles Grid */
       .featured-section {
            padding: 60px 40px;
            background-color: var(--white);
        }

       .section-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

       .section-top h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            font-size: 24px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

       .view-all {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--black);
        }

       .article-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
        }

       .article-card {
            border: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
            padding: 25px;
            background-color: var(--white);
        }

       .card-category {
            color: var(--burgundy);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
        }

       .card-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

       .card-excerpt {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

       .read-more {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--black);
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Arşiv Göz Atma ve Kırmızı Bloklar */
       .archive-footer-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr 1fr;
            min-height: 400px;
        }

       .browse-sidebar {
            background-color: var(--burgundy);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 50px 40px;
        }

       .browse-sidebar h3 {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

       .archive-menu {
            list-style: none;
        }

       .archive-menu li {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

       .archive-menu li:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

       .quote-block {
            background-color: var(--black);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 80px 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

       .quote-icon {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

       .quote-text {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

       .quote-author {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--gray-mid);
        }

       .about-project {
            background-color: var(--burgundy);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 80px 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

       .about-title {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

       .about-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

       .btn-learn {
            border: 1px solid var(--white);
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        /* Alt Bilgi - Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--black);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 80px 40px 20px 40px;
        }

       .footer-main {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr 1fr 1fr 350px;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

       .footer-va {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 80px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

       .footer-col h4 {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #888;
        }

       .footer-col ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

       .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

       .footer-col ul li a {
            color: var(--white);
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

       .newsletter-col h4 {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

       .newsletter-form {
            display: flex;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #444;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

       .newsletter-form input {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--white);
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px 0;
            outline: none;
        }

       .btn-subscribe {
            background-color: var(--burgundy);
            color: var(--white);
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

       .copyright {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
            padding-top: 30px;
        }

        /* İllüstrasyon Yerleşimi */
       .illustration-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }

       .diag-item {
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 11px;
            position: absolute;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="top-bar">
        <span>Fashion as a Discipline.</span>
        <span>Research. Context. Culture.</span>
    </div>

    <header>
        <div class="header-utility">
            <div class="left-side"><span>🔍</span> Search</div>
            <div class="right-side"><span>📚</span> Library</div>
        </div>
        <h1 class="logo">VESTIGE ARCHIVE</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">A Scholarly Archive of Fashion, Dress, and Cultural Study</div>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#" class="active">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Archive</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Articles</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Timeline</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Themes</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Contributors</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <span class="hero-label">Fashion as a Discipline</span>
                <h2 class="hero-title">Dress is Knowledge.</h2>
                <p class="hero-description">An intellectual history of fashion as a social practice, material culture, and system of meaning.</p>
                <button class="btn-explore">Explore the Archive</button>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-visuals">
                <div class="illustration-container">
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x500/F5F3EE/800000?text=Roman+Dress" alt="Classical Dress" class="visual-img">
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150x300/F5F3EE/800000?text=Corset" alt="Anatomy of Dress" class="visual-img">
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x450/F5F3EE/800000?text=Victorian+Dress" alt="Bustle Silhouette" class="visual-img">
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/120x350/F5F3EE/800000?text=Top+Hat+Gent" alt="Modern Attire" class="visual-img">
                </div>
                
                <div class="society-diagram">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" width="200">
                        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#333" />
                        <text x="100" y="105" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12">Dress</text>
                        <line x1="100" y1="70" x2="100" y2="40" stroke="#333" />
                        <text x="100" y="35" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10">Class</text>
                        <line x1="70" y1="100" x2="40" y2="100" stroke="#333" />
                        <text x="35" y="105" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10">Power</text>
                    </svg>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="featured-section">
            <div class="section-top">
                <h2>Featured Articles</h2>
                <a href="#" class="view-all">View All Articles ></a>
            </div>
            <div class="article-grid">
                <article class="article-card">
                    <span class="card-category">Sociology</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">The Sociology of the Silhouette</h3>
                    <p class="card-excerpt">How shape, form, and volume reflect systems of power, gender, and identity.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="read-more">Read Article →</a>
                </article>
                <article class="article-card">
                    <span class="card-category">History</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">From Rome to Renaissance: A Fabric History</h3>
                    <p class="card-excerpt">Textiles, trade, and technology across two thousand years of dress.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="read-more">Read Article →</a>
                </article>
                <article class="article-card">
                    <span class="card-category">Theory</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Dress as Language</h3>
                    <p class="card-excerpt">Semiotics, symbols, and the codes embedded in what we wear.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="read-more">Read Article →</a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="archive-footer-layout">
            <div class="browse-sidebar">
                <h3>Browse the Archive</h3>
                <ul class="archive-menu">
                    <li>Timeline of Fashion History <span>></span></li>
                    <li>Garment Typologies <span>></span></li>
                    <li>Textile & Material Culture <span>></span></li>
                    <li>Theoretical Frameworks <span>></span></li>
                    <li>Regional Studies <span>></span></li>
                    <li>Primary Sources <span>></span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="quote-block">
                <div class="quote-icon">“</div>
                <p class="quote-text">Fashion is not frivolous. It is a mirror of the world and a record of its values.</p>
                <p class="quote-author">— Joan De Jean, 1967</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-project">
                <h4 class="about-title">Research. Context. Culture.</h4>
                <p class="about-text">Vestige Archive is an evolving resource for students, scholars, and thinkers exploring fashion beyond the surface—through history, theory, and material reality.</p>
                <button class="btn-learn">Learn More About the Project</button>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-main">
            <div class="footer-va">VA</div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Archive</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Browse All</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Collections</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Contributors</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Resources</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Glossary</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Reading Lists</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Teaching Resources</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>About</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Mission</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Editorial Board</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col newsletter-col">
                <h4>Stay Informed</h4>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px; opacity: 0.6;">Subscribe to our newsletter</p>
                <div class="newsletter-form">
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Your email address">
                    <button class="btn-subscribe">Subscribe</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="copyright">© 2024 Vestige Archive. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
